ontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/593714175_1609142190846322_3455532127574096914_n.png?_nc_cat=102&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=wP83Rd4HFeoQ7kNvwG-I1Le&_nc_oc=AdpYFwwuaovRN8Ka4L85rnLZFCkGjc7ddbolFuPj9k1p6OEZuQMlLBHR3OVPGcJxmNM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRVLgF_O43VUG5_2GGCLQr7hv80ZZ_nFB4Ehv_2YB1mjA&oe=6AFB4CA3"}, {"file_name": "5_menu.png", "id": "1775986336672912", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619059_1775986340006245_2739520621366716411_n.png?_nc_cat=102&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Sp2RH242bQsQ7kNvwGbZ2CD&_nc_oc=AdpUuUuJBAws_2LIqiAdIkZKmUvkRwSsOIWMdc5nszC0ZBuyY3W-75kgxjEhxwMeVNo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRMaqUbI0ItxTzJvciP279lohwYwnQCUI_oR4QVkpHjNg&oe=6AFB38AD"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "HeatXR_trailer_cover_2560x1440.png", "id": "4452977968274780", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491824292_4452977971608113_7242965164107465381_n.png?_nc_cat=110&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=naF5nPmAkwoQ7kNvwH2zTj0&_nc_oc=AdqcH5aq7nxpCR4akXZR-T1iyoEZ-9eZeMr2uO_Nb4VTJmASV2clvD0snVR1q1CbOxQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRdY2PSJi6w4jsTTWaUgoPILMUmTiH7Xw3YEnMOvu0GUA&oe=6AFB22CD"}, "display_name": "HeatXR: Boxing, Fitness, Cardio Workout", "keywords": ["exercise", "rhythm", "HIIT", "punch", "sports"], "long_description": "### \ud83e\udd4a Box to the beat. Feel every punch.\n\nTargets fly in on the beat and every hit lands with **light, sound and haptics**. HeatXR builds **a new boxing workout every session**, so you never learn it by heart.\n\n{1133079069272961}\n\n### \ud83d\udc4a Real boxing moves\n{1281734910793475}\n**Jab, cross, hooks, uppercuts, elbows and doubles**\nSwitch between orthodox and southpaw as you go.\n\n### \ud83d\udd25 Full-body cardio\n\n**Duck, slip and weave** under the blades and squat on the beat. Your legs and core work as hard as your arms.\n\n{1006069205842536}\n\n### \ud83c\udfb5 Your songs, your workout\n\nCopy your own songs to the headset (MP3, M4A, AAC, FLAC, OGG, Opus or WAV). HeatXR maps each one and **writes the workout to its beat**. Streaming services aren't supported. No songs? **Beat-only workouts** play on their own.\n\n{28834634789550736}\n\n### \ud83d\udcaa Seven workouts, your pick\n\n**Full Body, Boxing, HIIT, Upper Body, Lower Body, Core and Flow**, at Light, Medium or Intense, for 5 to 30 minutes. **Coaches Cole and Jade** count you in and push you through.\n\n{1828082595003951}\n\n### \ud83c\udf04 Nine real worlds\n\nSnowy forests, sea cliffs, sunset beaches and mountain meadows, all around you in **true 3D**. Track estimated calories, accuracy and streaks after every workout.\n\n{972186785436273}\n\n### \u2705 Pay once. No subscription.\n\n- No account, no sign-up\n- No internet needed\n- Everything stays on your headset\n\n{1353483793392585}", "short_description": "A boxing workout to the beat, in real 3D worlds. Punch targets as they fly in (jab, cross, hook, uppercut, elbows), then duck, slip and weave under the blades for full-body cardio. Every session is a new workout, timed to your own songs or to the beat alone. Boxing, HIIT, Core and four more workouts, Light to Intense, 5 to 30 minutes. Coaches Cole and Jade count you in and push you through. Calories and progress tracked. No account needed. Pay once, no subscription."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://heatxr.com/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "HeatXR Studios", "support_website_url": "https://heatxr.com/support", "website_url": "https://heatxr.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "810139357995560"}, {"id": "2776542